# Domain Model Documentation

## 1. Domain Concepts

### Step 1: Domain Concepts Identification

| Concept | Type | Responsibility Description | Responsibility Type |
|---------|------|----------------------------|---------------------|
| SearchInterface | Boundary | Interface for user search interactions | Doing: Handle user input/output |
| AccountInterface | Boundary | Interface for account management | Doing: Handle login/profile management |
| WebmasterPortal | Boundary | Interface for website owners | Doing: Handle performance monitoring & requests |
| CompliancePortal | Boundary | Interface for legal authorities | Doing: Handle legal requests |
| SearchController | Control | Manage search flow and coordination | Doing: Coordinate search process |
| AccountController | Control | Manage account operations | Doing: Handle authentication & profile updates |
| RequestController | Control | Manage various requests | Doing: Process reports, updates, legal requests |
| User | Entity | Represent system user | Knowing: User identity and basic info |
| GuestUser | Entity | Represent unauthenticated user | Knowing: Session data and temporary identity |
| RegisteredUser | Entity | Represent authenticated user | Knowing: Account details and preferences |
| WebsiteOwner | Entity | Represent content provider | Knowing: Website information and ownership |
| Authority | Entity | Represent legal entity | Knowing: Jurisdiction and authority level |
| Query | Entity | Represent search request | Knowing: Search parameters and intent |
| SearchSession | Entity | Represent search interaction period | Knowing: Session data and activity timeline |
| SearchResult | Entity | Represent individual search result | Knowing: Result content and metadata |
| Bookmark | Entity | Represent saved result | Knowing: Saved content reference and metadata |
| SearchHistory | Entity | Record of user searches | Knowing: Historical search patterns |
| IssueReport | Entity | User-submitted problem report | Knowing: Issue details and status |
| UpdateRemovalRequest | Entity | Website owner content request | Knowing: Request details and target |
| PerformanceMetrics | Entity | Search performance data | Knowing: Analytics and performance data |
| LegalRequest | Entity | Legal/compliance request | Knowing: Legal requirements and status |


## 2. Associations

### Step 2: Domain Associations

| Association Name | Association Description | Concept Pair |
|------------------|-------------------------|--------------|
| interacts_with | User interacts with system interfaces | User ↔ SearchInterface |
| manages_flow | Controller manages use case flow | SearchController ↔ SearchInterface |
| processes | Controller processes entity data | SearchController ↔ Query |
| initiates | User starts search session | User ↔ SearchSession |
| contains | Session contains multiple queries | SearchSession ↔ Query |
| generates | Query produces search results | Query ↔ SearchResult |
| maintains | User keeps bookmarks | RegisteredUser ↔ Bookmark |
| references | Bookmark points to result | Bookmark ↔ SearchResult |
| records | History logs user queries | SearchHistory ↔ Query |
| submits_report | User reports issues | User ↔ IssueReport |
| concerns | Report about specific result | IssueReport ↔ SearchResult |
| creates_request | Owner makes update requests | WebsiteOwner ↔ UpdateRemovalRequest |
| targets | Request affects specific result | UpdateRemovalRequest ↔ SearchResult |
| monitors | Owner tracks performance | WebsiteOwner ↔ PerformanceMetrics |
| submits_legal | Authority submits legal requests | Authority ↔ LegalRequest |
| authenticates | System verifies user identity | AccountController ↔ RegisteredUser |
| coordinates | Controller manages search process | SearchController ↔ SearchSession |
| handles_requests | Controller processes various requests | RequestController ↔ IssueReport |
| manages_account | Controller handles user profiles | AccountController ↔ User |
| displays_data | Interface shows information | SearchInterface ↔ SearchResult |


