## 4. Generalizations
 ### Step 4: Generalization Relationships

| Child Concept | Parent Concept | Inheritance Basis |
|---------------|----------------|-------------------|
| GuestUser | User | Shares basic user identification attributes (userId, email, name) |
| RegisteredUser | User | Inherits base user attributes, adds authentication and preferences |
| WebsiteOwner | RegisteredUser | Inherits all user attributes, adds website management capabilities |
| Authority | RegisteredUser | Inherits user attributes, adds legal authority attributes |


## 5. Pre- and Post-Conditions

### Step 5: Key Pre- and Post-Conditions

| Use Case | Pre-Conditions | Post-Conditions |
|----------|----------------|-----------------|
| UC-01: Submit Query | Search interface available, internet access | Results displayed or error message shown |
| UC-02: View Results | Valid query submitted, results available | Results viewed or user chooses to refine/open |
| UC-05: Save Bookmark | User logged in, viewing search results | Bookmark saved to user's collection |
| UC-06: Manage Account | User authenticated, account settings accessible | Account data updated and confirmed |
| UC-07: Report Issue | Search results displayed | Issue report stored for moderator review |
| UC-08: Request Update/Removal | URL currently indexed | Request recorded and forwarded for review |
| UC-09: Monitor Performance | Website successfully indexed | Performance data reviewed by owner |
| UC-10: Submit Legal Request | Authorized access to compliance portal | Request recorded, validated, assigned tracking ID |
